        "attribution": "Castelnovo, Moessner, and Sondhi made the influential theoretical proposal; experimental confirmation and characterization were essential to establishing the phenomenon.",
        "maturity": "Spin-ice behavior is well established, although the monopoles are emergent quasiparticles rather than fundamental magnetic charges.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "How broadly the discovery should be credited across the experimental work and later theoretical development is not fully captured by the proposed names."
